{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WISHLIST NOW BEFORE THE STORM HITS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/Wild_Mars_approaching_storm-Anim.gif?t=1741619687\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Mars survival management simulator in which you must produce fuel from bacteria and algae to leave Mars before an incoming storm destroys your base. Defend your base from the bacteria that infest it. Manage the fuel that also powers your base's elevator. Make crucial decisions to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEFEND YOUR BASE FROM THE BACTERIA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/Wild_Mars_Bacteria_Anim.gif?t=1741619687\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MAKE CRUCIAL DECISIONS TO SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/Wild_Mars_Decisions_Anim.gif?t=1741619687\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870620/extras/Wild_Mars_Frozen_Anim.gif?t=1741619687\" /><br><br>MANAGE THE FUEL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage the fuel that also powers your base's elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage oxygen and energy, make water from ice, resist cold and radiation, grow crops, mine minerals. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Environments to upgrade with faster and most advanced technologies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Research and combine new elements to improve fuel production </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Upgrade your equipment </p></li></ul>","background":"htt